title: Payers › Edit log
route: /payers/:id
intro: The 'Edit log' button opens a read-only drawer listing every edit to this payer, newest first, with who, when, why and the old and new text. A row of area buttons (All, Workflow, Rules, Documents, Caller instructions, Payer details) narrows the list; History & Changes holds the same list under 'Edit audit'. It is the only record of a change: there is no undo or revert button.
dir: TD
---
start s1 "Click 'Edit log'\nin the payer header"
overlay dr "Edit log drawer\n'Every edit to Summit Medicaid HMO, newest first'"
decision any "Has anything been edited for this payer?"
screen em "'No edits yet'\nEvery edit to a workflow, rules, script or document list is logged here\nwith your name, the time and your reason."
screen ent "One card per edit\nArea chip, bold 'what changed'"
process who "Line under it: '{viewer} · Tue 10:42 am · Reason: ...'\nThe name is the person viewing when the edit was saved (Jordan Perez at the start; Dr. Rivera, Alex Morgan or Sam Okafor after 'Viewing as')"
screen ba "Two boxes with an arrow\nRed 'Before' (or 'Nothing' for an addition)\nGreen 'After' (or 'Removed' for a removal)"

group gA "Where entries come from (area chip)"
  store a1 "Workflow\nSave, publish, archive or restore a workflow, accept a suggestion"
  store a2 "Rules\nSave, add, verify or archive a rule"
  store a3 "Documents\nSave a document list,\nand documents added by a payer change"
  store a4 "Caller instructions\nSave the script"
  store a5 "Payer details\nEdit payer, Add a payer"
endgroup

process cnt "Header button count 'Edit log (3)'\ncounts entries for this payer only\nEach changed field is its own entry"
process ro "Read only\nNo search, revert or export"
click fl "Click an area button\nExample: 'Workflow 2'"
process flp "Only that area shows\nEvery area has a count\nAn area with none reads 'No Rules edits'"
click cc "Click the X ('Close'),\npress Escape or click the dimmed area"
end e1 "Drawer closes\nPage underneath unchanged"
goto g1 "Continues in: Payers › Workflow Builder › Save a draft and publish"
goto g2 "Continues in: Payers › Rules & Instructions › Edit a rule"
goto g3 "Continues in: Payers › Rules & Instructions › Edit the document list"

s1 --> dr --> any
dr --> fl --> flp --> ent
any -->|No| em --> cc
any -->|Yes| ent --> who --> ba --> cc
ent --> cnt
dr -.-> ro
cc --> e1
a1 --> ent
a2 --> ent
a3 --> ent
a4 --> ent
a5 --> ent
a1 -.-> g1
a2 -.-> g2
a3 -.-> g3
